{"_id":"68dce118166b018f83df759e","roadmapSlug":"css","nodeId":"zW49OvVO-kLh0M4JCE4_w","description":"# Frontend Development\n\nFrontend development involves crafting the user interface and user experience of a website or web application. It focuses on the parts of a website that users directly interact with, such as buttons, text, images, and navigation. Frontend developers use languages like HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to build these interactive elements and ensure they function correctly across different browsers and devices.","resources":[{"type":"roadmap","title":"Visit the dedicated Frontend Roadmap","url":"https://roadmap.sh/frontend","_id":"6a67293033d15c8310214486"},{"type":"article","title":"Front-End Development: The Complete Guide","url":"https://cloudinary.com/guides/front-end-development/front-end-development-the-complete-guide","_id":"6a67293033d15c8310214487"},{"type":"video","title":"Frontend web development - a complete overview","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WG5ikvJ2TKA","_id":"6a67293033d15c8310214488"}],"createdAt":"2025-10-01T08:06:48.336Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-27T09:47:28.129Z","lessonPacks":[{"_id":"6a22adddac1c5fa9928ab3ab","title":"CSS Fundamentals","slug":"css","description":"Style, lay out, and debug real pages without fighting the cascade.","lessonIds":["6a15d62fac1c5fa9928a3fb6","6a15e1b0ac1c5fa9928a403f","6a16f11aac1c5fa9928a7c14","6a19dcdfac1c5fa9928a84a5","6a19e79cac1c5fa9928a8571","6a19f85cac1c5fa9928a8654","6a1d7a23ac1c5fa9928a8b4e","6a1dd2daac1c5fa9928a9884","6a1ecf18ac1c5fa9928a9a81","6a1f3245ac1c5fa9928a9cdd","6a20aa64ac1c5fa9928aa44a","6a20ba69ac1c5fa9928aa755","6a20c105ac1c5fa9928aa818","6a20c2e5ac1c5fa9928aa847","6a20c490ac1c5fa9928aa871","6a20c5adac1c5fa9928aa884","6a20c6a5ac1c5fa9928aa897","6a20c7c5ac1c5fa9928aa8aa","6a20ca2fac1c5fa9928aa8d0","6a20cb82ac1c5fa9928aa8e3"],"projectIds":["68b7185fffbff9183d772aed","68b7185fffbff9183d772aee","68b7185fffbff9183d772af0","68b7185fffbff9183d772af6","6a26960eac1c5fa9928acb63",